nter;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .fold {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .board-rec {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .top-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .mark-here {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 18px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .box {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .see-reverse { font-weight: bold; }\n  .lower {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 30px;\n    margin-top: 120px;\n  }\n  .col-left { width: 340px; flex: 0 0 340px; }\n  .col-right { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .prop-label { font-weight: bold; }\n  .prop1 {\n    display: flex;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .prop1 .txt { margin-left: 6px; }\n  .nominees-line { text-align: right; font-weight: bold; }\n  .nominee-names { margin-left: 40px; }\n  .forwithhold {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 30px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    margin-top: 34px;\n  }\n  .forwithhold > div { width: 150px; }\n  .fw-boxes {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 30px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n  .fw-boxes > div { width: 150px; text-align: center; }\n  .withhold-note {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 70px;\n  }\n  .sig-line {\n    border-top: 2px solid #555;\n    width: 300px;\n    margin-top: 55px;\n  }\n  .prop2-row {\n    display: flex;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .prop2-text { margin-left: 6px; }\n  .vote-head {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 34px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .vote-head span { width: 66px; text-align: center; }\n  .vote-boxes {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 34px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .vote-boxes span { width: 66px; text-align: center; }\n  .prop2-wrap { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .prop2-wrap .left { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .prop2-wrap .right { flex: 0 0 240px; }\n  .transact {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .ed-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .ed-text { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .ed-side {\n    flex: 0 0 90px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .ed-side .box { display: block; margin-top: 55px; }\n  .attend {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    margin-top: 70px;\n  }\n  .attend .box { margin-left: 22px; }\n  .final {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"serif\">accounting principles or otherwise comply with applicable laws.</div>\n\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">A-4</div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule-thick\"></div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"company\">NVIDIA CORPORATION</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"subhead\">\n    PROXY SOLICITED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS<br>\n    FOR THE ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS<br>\n    TO BE HELD ON JULY 10, 2003\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"body indent\">The undersigned hereby appoints Jen-Hsun Huang and Marvin D. Burkett and each of them, as attorneys-in-fact and proxies of the undersigned, with full power of substitution, to vote all of the shares of stock of NVIDIA Corporation, which the undersigned may be entitled to vote at the Annual Meeting of Stockholders of NVIDIA Corporation to be held at the Company's executive office at 2701 San Tomas Expressway, Santa Clara, California 95050 on Thursday, July 10, 2003 at 2:00 p.m., local time (and at any and all postponements, continuations and adjournments thereof), with all powers that the undersigned would possess if personally present, upon and in respect of the following matters and in accordance with the following instructions, with discretionary authority as to any and all other matters that may properly come before the meeting.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"allcapsbold\">UNLESS A CONTRARY DIRECTION IS INDICATED, THIS PROXY WILL BE VOTED \"FOR\" ALL NOMINEES LISTED IN PROPOSAL 1 and \"FOR\" PROPOSAL 2, AS MORE SPECIFICALLY DESCRIBED IN THE PROXY STATEMENT. IF SPECIFIC INSTRUCTIONS ARE INDICATED, THIS PROXY WILL BE VOTED IN ACCORDANCE THEREWITH.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"continued\">(Continued and to be signed on other side)</div>\n\n  <div class=\"addr-box\">\n    Address Change/Comments (Mark the corresponding box on the reverse side)\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule-thin\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"fold\">^&nbsp; FOLD AND DETACH HERE ^</div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule-thick\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-row\">\n    <div class=\"board-rec\">THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS A VOTE \"FOR\" PROPOSAL 1 AND PROPOSAL 2.</div>\n    <div class=\"mark-here\">\n      <div>\n        Please<br>\n        Mark Here<br>\n        for Address<br>\n        Change or<br>\n        Comments<br>\n        <span class=\"see-reverse\">SEE REVERSE SIDE</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"box\">|_|</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"lower\">\n\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"prop1\">\n        <div class=\"prop-label\">PROPOSAL 1:</div>\n        <div class=\"txt\">\n          To elect two directors to hold office until<br>\n          the 2006 Annual Meeting of Stockholders.\n          <div class=\"nominees-line\">NOMINEES: <span class=\"nominee-names\" style=\"font-weight:normal;\">01 Tench Coxe,</span></div>\n          <div style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"margin-right:22px;\">02 Mark A. Stevens</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"forwithhold\">\n        <div><strong>FOR</strong> all nominees listed above (except as marked to the contrary below)</div>\n        <div><strong>WITHHOLD AUTHORITY</strong> to vote for all nominees listed above</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fw-boxes\">\n        <div><span class=\"box\">|_|</span></div>\n        <div><span class=\"box\">|_|</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"withhold-note\">\n        TO WITHHOLD AUTHORITY TO VOTE FOR ANY<br>\n        NOMINEE, WRITE SUCH NOMINEE'S NAME BELOW:\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sig-line\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"prop2-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"left\">\n          <div class=\"prop2-row\">\n            <div class=\"prop-label\">PROPOSAL 2:</div>\n            <div class=\"prop2-text\">\n              To ratify the selection of KPMG LLP as NVIDIA's independent<br>\n              <span style=\"margin-left:22px;\">auditors for the fiscal year ending January 25, 2004.</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right\">\n          <div class=\"vote-head\"><span>FOR</span><span>AGAINST</span><span>ABSTAIN</span></div>\n          <div class=\"vote-boxes\"><span class=\"box\">|_|</span><span class=\"box\">|_|</span><span class=\"box\">|_|</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"transact\">\n        To transact such other business as may properly come before the meeting, or any adjournments, continuations or postponements thereof.\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ed-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"ed-text\">\n          <strong>ELECTRONIC DELIVERY:</strong> Please disregard if you have previously provided your consent.<br>\n          By checking the box to the right, I consent to future delivery of annual reports, proxy statements, prospectuses and other materials and stockholder communications electronically via the Internet at a webpage which will be disclosed to me. I understand that the Company will no longer be required to distribute to me printed materials relating to any future stockholder meeting until my consent is revoked. I understand that I may revoke my consent at any time by contacting the Company's transfer agent, Mellon Investor Services LLC, 85 Challenger Road, Ridgefield Park, New Jersey 07660, and that costs associated with electronic delivery, such as usage and telephone charges as well as any costs I may incur in printing documents, will not be reimbursed by the Company.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ed-side\">\n          AGREE\n          <span class=\"box\">|_|</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"attend\">Mark box if you plan to attend the meeting <span class=\"box\">|_|</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"final\">PLEASE VOTE, DATE AND PROMPTLY RETURN THIS PROXY IN THE ENCLOSED RETURN ENVELOPE, WHICH IS POSTAGE PREPAID IF MAILED IN THE</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
